  "limitations": [
    "The repository contained no pretrained PA checkpoint, so all arms used the same deterministic surrogate PA trained once on the bundled dataset.",
    "The production-density comparison covers one 357-update epoch, while the multi-epoch gate covers three 23-update epochs; it is not a 240- or 300-epoch convergence study.",
    "The strict CUDA-graph path is an explicit opt-in specialized to the measured FP32 TRes-DeltaGRU to frozen-DGRU cascade and MSE training.",
    "Existing EVM semantics were preserved: calculate_metrics does not forward the dataset sample rate to EVM, so its default 800 MHz is used."
